From 3c592c54cf1c06b66e3ad7b4ddb3067b9ae41fa1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 08:24:24 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] chronik: native V2 v2_index env and branch, explorer and
 asset DB

Port of chronik-db mdbx.rs, v2_branch.rs, v2_explorer.rs and v2_asset.rs
(design C1 section 4, V2 tier): the v2_index MDBX env (schema 3, 16
named DBIs, v2_tx_NNNNN.dat flat files), postcard records byte-identical
to Rust, the committed-block transitions (genesis, connect, disconnect
with undo), read snapshots for branch postings/UTXOs, explorer
blocks/txs/inputs/witnesses/wire slices and asset summaries/events/
outputs, with the Rust tests ported (env, branch incl. crash recovery,
asset, explorer model).

The env is MDBX-only like Rust's, so the V2 service is built only with
CHRONIK_NATIVE_MDBX. Errors are V2Error exceptions carrying the Rust
Display text; MDBX error texts use the native store's format.

Tier: V2
